   jurisdictions do not allow these limits, so they may not apply to you.

9. Termination

   This agreement lasts until it ends. It ends automatically if you breach it. When it ends, stop
   using the Software and delete it. Sections 3, 7 and 8 survive the end of this agreement.

10. Changes

   A later version of the Software may come with a different agreement, which applies to that
